title: Business Workflow Order Processing
direction: down

Start: {
  label: Start Order Process
  shape: circle
}

Process: {
  label: Process Order
  shape: rectangle
}

Decision: {
  label: Order Valid?
  shape: diamond
}

Success: {
  label: Order Confirmed
  shape: rectangle
  style: {
    fill: "#d1e7dd"
  }
}

Retry: {
  label: Retry Processing
  shape: rectangle
  style: {
    fill: "#fff3cd"
  }
}

Start -> Process
Process -> Decision
Decision -> Success: Yes
Decision -> Retry: No
Retry -> Process
